<title>USA: Revlon in joint venture in China.</title>
<headline>Revlon in joint venture in China.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Revlon Inc's Revlon Consumer Products Corp said Tuesday it entered a joint venture agreement with Sumstar Group Corp, a Beijing-based investment firm, to manufacture, distribute and market Revlon products in China.</p>
<p>Distribution of the company's products in major cities throughout China should begin in the first quarter of 1997, and office headquarters and manufacturing facilities will be located in Shanghai, Revlon said.</p>
</text>
